      "created_at": "2014-03-27T21:58:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Sentinels of the Multiverse: Shattered Timelines is now available! This expansion brings two time-traveling heroes, four awful (yet familiar) villains, and two time-displaced environments! Experience the alternate realities that make up the Multiverse!<br>\nCan you repair time before it runs out?!</p>\n<p>From the Sentinels website<br>\nMy question is … what part of time are we repairing as we play sentinels?</p>\n<p>Is the main one visionary saving the dreamer… which makes sense</p>\n<p>but what about the Iron Legacy timeline … is that just a WHAT IF timeline? if so it can be completely ignored or did the actual (main timeline) heroes interact with this time line … if so how? we haven’t seen any dimension hoping characters? and who restored the timeline? or is this a spoiler to a future hero?</p>\n<p>Or am I thinking too hard about a game based on comic book conventions ?</p>",
