      "id": 97635,
      "name": "Matchstickman",
      "username": "Matchstickman",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-03-27T22:24:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>No one restored the timeline, we are in timeline C now (A being Legacy dying with Young Legacy stepping up, B being Young Legacy dying leading to Iron Legacy). Something happened to the multiverse and allowed Timeline B to intersect with 'our' timeline, leading to a future where neither of the Legacies died (as relayed in the Beacon Tactics update).</p><p>We still have no idea what weakened the fabric of reality to allow this, but wild speculation is that it is to be the 'big boss' of the Sentinels' card game.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I think repair is the wrong word, replace might be better.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:25:03.548Z",
